<title>UK: CLF Hypo adds 100 million marks to step-up bond.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypo adds 100 million marks to step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable bond, announced Monday by lead manager Deutsche Genossenschaftsbank, has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT  **200 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.50	MATURITY    02.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE  L 01.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.125     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES     *T0 02.OCT.97, THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP</p>
<p>		TO 5.5 PERCENT TO MATURITY.</p>
<p>	    **ORIGINAL 100 MLN DEM LAUNCHED 02.SEP.96</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF, EMISION 438</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
